{"case": "ablation_t1_no_easter_holidays", "step": "all rows / payment method == 'LS' / proposals for collection", "note": "kept: exact rows (search, held out) (12143, 2829) -> (12183, 2845)", "time": "03:08:10", "tried": [], "proposals": {"proposed: next business day (Ticino, fixed + Easter movable feasts) (answer 1) (extends: next business day (Ticino, fixed only))": "def brick(d: dt.date) -> dt.date:\n    # name: next business day (Ticino, fixed + Easter movable feasts)\n\n    def _easter(year: int) -> dt.date:\n        a = year % 19\n        b = year // 100\n        c = year % 100\n        dd = b // 4\n        e = b % 4\n        f = (b + 8) // 25\n        g = (b - f + 1) // 3\n        h = (19 * a + b - dd - g + 15) % 30\n        i = c // 4\n        k = c % 4\n        l = (32 + 2 * e + 2 * i - h - k) % 7\n        m = (a + 11 * h + 22 * l) // 451\n        month = (h + l - 7 * m + 114) // 31\n        day = ((h + l - 7 * m + 114) % 31) + 1\n        return dt.date(year, month, day)\n\n    es = _easter(d.year)\n    movable_holidays = {\n        es - dt.timedelta(days=2),    # Good Friday (Venerd\u00ec Santo)\n        es + dt.timedelta(days=1),    # Easter Monday (Luned\u00ec dell'Angelo)\n        es + dt.timedelta(days=39),   # Ascension (Ascensione)\n        es + dt.timedelta(days=49),   # Pentecost (Pentecoste) \u2013 always Sunday\n        es + dt.timedelta(days=50),   # Whit Monday (Luned\u00ec di Pentecoste)\n        es + dt.timedelta(days=60),   # Corpus Christi (Corpo di Dio)\n    }\n\n    result = best(d)\n    while result in movable_holidays:\n        result = best(result + dt.timedelta(days=1))\n    return result\n", "proposed: next business day (Ticino) including Easter movable holidays (answer 2) (extends: next business day (Ticino, fixed only))": "# name: next business day (Ticino) including Easter movable holidays\ndef brick(d):\n    def easter_sunday(y):\n        a = y % 19\n        b = y // 100\n        c = y % 100\n        dd = b // 4\n        e = b % 4\n        f = (b + 8) // 25\n        g = (b - f + 1) // 3\n        h = (19 * a + b - dd - g + 15) % 30\n        i = c // 4\n        k = c % 4\n        l = (32 + 2 * e + 2 * i - h - k) % 7\n        m = (a + 11 * h + 22 * l) // 451\n        month = (h + l - 7 * m + 114) // 31\n        day = ((h + l - 7 * m + 114) % 31) + 1\n        return dt.date(y, month, day)\n\n    result = best(d)\n    while True:\n        es = easter_sunday(result.year)\n        movable = {\n            es - dt.timedelta(days=2),    # Good Friday\n            es + dt.timedelta(days=1),    # Easter Monday\n            es + dt.timedelta(days=39),   # Ascension\n            es + dt.timedelta(days=50),   # Whit Monday\n            es + dt.timedelta(days=60),   # Corpus Christi\n        }\n        if result not in movable:\n            return result\n        result = best(result + dt.timedelta(days=1))\n"}, "accepted": ["proposed: next business day (Ticino, fixed + Easter movable feasts) (answer 1) (extends: next business day (Ticino, fixed only))"]}
